[TITLE]
CON-09: 10-ac fully impervious subcatchment with 0.2 in depression storage.
Storm 1 (0.1 in, hour 1) only fills depression storage; 12 h of evaporation
(0.5 in/day) take 0.025 in of that water. Storm 2 (0.3 in, hour 14) fills
the depressions and runs off. Rain carries 10 mg/L of P1. Every pound
deposited must end up in Surface Runoff or Remaining Buildup.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         KINWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/02/2020
END_TIME             00:00:00
DRY_STEP             00:05:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         60
REPORT_STEP          01:00:00

[EVAPORATION]
CONSTANT  0.5
DRY_ONLY  NO

[RAINGAGES]
G1  INTENSITY  1:00  1.0  TIMESERIES  RAIN

[TIMESERIES]
RAIN  01/01/2020  00:00  0.1
RAIN  01/01/2020  01:00  0.0
RAIN  01/01/2020  13:00  0.3
RAIN  01/01/2020  14:00  0.0

[SUBCATCHMENTS]
S1  G1  J1  10  100  500  0.5  0

[SUBAREAS]
S1  0.01  0.1  0.2  0.2  0  OUTLET

[INFILTRATION]
S1  3.0  0.5  4  7  0

[JUNCTIONS]
J1   1   5   0   0   0

[OUTFALLS]
O1   0   FREE

[CONDUITS]
C1  J1  O1  400  0.013  0  0  0

[XSECTIONS]
